khupadāyataṁ.", "Viraddhatthavipallāsa-ganthavitthārahāniyā.", "Visuddhiṁ pāpayissāmi, satte saṁsāradukkhato.", "Lokiyehi ca bhogehi, guṇehi nikhilā pajā.", "Sabbehi sahitā hontu, ratā sambuddhasāsaneti."], "app": []}, {"label": null, "lines": ["Vimativinodanīṭīkā niṭṭhitā."], "app": []}]}